{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os' data-target='computer\/os' data-title='OS'>\r\n\t\t\tOS\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/windows' data-target='computer\/os\/windows' data-title='Windows'>\r\n\t\t\tWindows\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Windows Recovery Environment layout, ReAgentC info/enable/disable, and reagentc /setosimage for Winre.wim and install.wim.","label":"Recovery","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/windows\/readyboost","label":"ReadyBoost","url":"\/computer\/os\/windows\/readyboost"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/windows\/redistributables","label":"Redistributables","url":"\/computer\/os\/windows\/redistributables"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>https:\/\/technet.microsoft.com\/en-us\/library\/dd799242%28v=ws.10%29.aspx?f=255&amp;MSPPError=-2147217396<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>https:\/\/www.terabyteunlimited.com\/kb\/article.php?id=587<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>https:\/\/social.technet.microsoft.com\/Forums\/en-US\/9801aa0a-d876-4699-a31d-ba4ca08eea50\/solved-how-do-i-prepare-windows-recovery-environment-on-windows-10-taking-backup-measures-on-your?forum=WinPreview2014Setup<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tA recovery partition is required for Resetting. <code class='inline'>Winre.wim<\/code> is required to build a recovery drive.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>ReAgentC<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>info\nenable\ndisable<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tReports RE Status, RE Location, and BCD Identifier.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Layout<\/h2>\n\t<h4>Basic<\/h4>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>\\Recovery[\\&lt;GUID&gt;]\\\n    Winre.wim\n    ReAgent.xml\n    boot.sdi<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tOn MBR: System partition.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Install.wim<\/h4>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>reagentc.exe \/setosimage \/path C:\\OSMEDIA \/target c:\\Windows \/Index 1<\/code><\/pre>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/windows\/recovery\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/windows\/recovery\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/windows\/readyboost' data-target='computer\/os\/windows\/readyboost' data-title='ReadyBoost' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - previous page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div class='arrow'>&#x25C4;<\/div><div>ReadyBoost<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/windows\/redistributables' data-target='computer\/os\/windows\/redistributables' data-title='Redistributables' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - next page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Redistributables<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25BA;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/os\/windows' data-target='computer\/os\/windows' data-title='Windows'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/computer\/os\/windows.svg ' alt='Navigation - up level tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Windows<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25B2;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t<\/a> <\/div>\r\n"}